# UI theme

- Do not use inline `style` attributes. Do not use hex, `rgb(`, or `hsl(` values outside `static/theme.css`.
- JavaScript toggles classes only. Do not set element styles from script.
- User-facing strings come from `static/copy.js`. Copy them character for character from PROJECT_PLAN.md.
- Reuse the components in `static/components.css` before adding a new component.
- Never change guardrail copy without updating PROJECT_PLAN.md.
